      "text": " intentionally, while the remainder self-extinguished including all the\nflames burning in air (i.e., 0.21 nominal oxygen mole fraction). Elevated ambient oxygen\nconcentrations above normal air enhances the flammability of materials while ambient pressure\n(not discussed here) had a negligible effect [21, 23]. The 49 terminated flames reached 95.3% of",
