      "page": 30,
      "text": "Results:\n\nUltem and Nomex HT90-40 samples did not burn on ISS atmosphere\n21% to 22% O2\nFlow speeds around 15 cm/s\nSimilar to 1-g (Note: samples narrower on ISS)\n\nNomex-III sample did burn",
      "cites": [
       "PSI-26"
      ],
